                    Developed a custom optimizer for transformer models that reduces training time by 15% while maintaining accuracy.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
                    <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded">PyTorch</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded">Python</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded">CUDA</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
